{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Alien Strike: Blasting the Intruders",
    "steam_appid": 2876150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/1623d6f9fc14e65bb040261fc80ca14a.avif?t=1755286514\" width=616 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Alien Strike is a <strong>Run 'n Gun</strong> with retro energy! <strong>Slide, jump and shoot in 8 directions</strong> as you face an alien invasion in electrifying levels with pixelated visuals and lots of action. With <strong>local multiplayer for up to 3 players,</strong> take <strong>control of recruits, collect, upgrade and share weapons in real time</strong>, acquire energy for powerful special moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2990d43f4873459e2f413d4003efb10c.poster.webp?t=1755286514\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2990d43f4873459e2f413d4003efb10c.webp?t=1755286514\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/7423115315d1f2f575d71efb9e990532.avif?t=1755286514\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Equip two weapons and switch between them in the heat of combat. Collect the same weapon more than once to unleash its X version - turbocharged, with more aggressive shots, different shapes and increased firepower. Choose well, combine styles and turn the tables in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2b60646827f47612d6e57d63728bb940.poster.avif?t=1755286514\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2b60646827f47612d6e57d63728bb940.webp?t=1755286514\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/9c47bdd2396b1c3209b8ab80abbca114.avif?t=1755286514\" width=616 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Each defeated enemy fuels your special bar - and when it bursts, get ready for an explosion! Activate a devastating blow that clears the screen and commands respect. It's the kind of move that shines like a flashing neon in the chaos of the battlefield. The timing makes all the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2dec23a8d10adfcf8a95451997a4e4f5.poster.webp?t=1755286514\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2dec23a8d10adfcf8a95451997a4e4f5.webp?t=1755286514\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/f53f25eec4a3eb5ba2f2fa44b5864cf4.avif?t=1755286514\" width=616 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your team and engage in side-by-side combat in local co-op mode for up to 3 players. At full arcade pace, each player can run, climb cables, dominate the map and distribute lead in real time. Play with friends like old times - synchronization, chaos and camaraderie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/4e4630eb4a70d6ec549cb73ecaad094d.avif?t=1755286514\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on monsters in epic fights reminiscent of the golden age of arcades. Each boss brings unique attacks, unexpected patterns and a trail of destruction all around you. Survive the firefight and face the final battle like a true hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/1623d6f9fc14e65bb040261fc80ca14a.avif?t=1755286514\" width=616 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Alien Strike is a <strong>Run 'n Gun</strong> with retro energy! <strong>Slide, jump and shoot in 8 directions</strong> as you face an alien invasion in electrifying levels with pixelated visuals and lots of action. With <strong>local multiplayer for up to 3 players,</strong> take <strong>control of recruits, collect, upgrade and share weapons in real time</strong>, acquire energy for powerful special moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2990d43f4873459e2f413d4003efb10c.poster.webp?t=1755286514\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2990d43f4873459e2f413d4003efb10c.webp?t=1755286514\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/7423115315d1f2f575d71efb9e990532.avif?t=1755286514\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Equip two weapons and switch between them in the heat of combat. Collect the same weapon more than once to unleash its X version - turbocharged, with more aggressive shots, different shapes and increased firepower. Choose well, combine styles and turn the tables in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2b60646827f47612d6e57d63728bb940.poster.avif?t=1755286514\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2b60646827f47612d6e57d63728bb940.webp?t=1755286514\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/9c47bdd2396b1c3209b8ab80abbca114.avif?t=1755286514\" width=616 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Each defeated enemy fuels your special bar - and when it bursts, get ready for an explosion! Activate a devastating blow that clears the screen and commands respect. It's the kind of move that shines like a flashing neon in the chaos of the battlefield. The timing makes all the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2dec23a8d10adfcf8a95451997a4e4f5.poster.webp?t=1755286514\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2dec23a8d10adfcf8a95451997a4e4f5.webp?t=1755286514\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/f53f25eec4a3eb5ba2f2fa44b5864cf4.avif?t=1755286514\" width=616 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your team and engage in side-by-side combat in local co-op mode for up to 3 players. At full arcade pace, each player can run, climb cables, dominate the map and distribute lead in real time. Play with friends like old times - synchronization, chaos and camaraderie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/4e4630eb4a70d6ec549cb73ecaad094d.avif?t=1755286514\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on monsters in epic fights reminiscent of the golden age of arcades. Each boss brings unique attacks, unexpected patterns and a trail of destruction all around you. Survive the firefight and face the final battle like a true hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
